en:
"You lot are quite useful, aren't you?"{w}{p}"Now then, can you find the Wing Soul?{w}It is called the wings of all beings -- a shining wing whose very existence has gained a soul."{w}{p}"Finding it will not be easy.{w}We have not a single clue about it.{w}But once it is found, the Meatrif will be complete."{w}{p}"We are searching by our own means.
You go and try Natori."{w}{p}"I cannot say how far Natori's power will reach,
but I want to cast our net as wide as possible. I'm counting on you."{w}

"Smooth sailing so far.
At this rate we will reach the Palace
of the Sun before long."{w}

"Your Majesty,
it seems a magical barrier has been
raised around the Palace of the Sun."{w}

"The hole the magic cannon can open
will not be very large.
Only a few can board the Palace of the Sun."{w}

Through the small hole made by the magic cannon,
you passed from the Meatrif into the
Palace of the Sun.{w}

"Sure, we didn't go up in smoke in the blast, but...
there's no denyin' we've lost power.
Majesty, let's take 'er down nice an' slow."{w}

"Way to go!
I just knew you guys could pull it off!"{w}{p}"I wanted to praise you so much,
I came rushing all the way from Lumisthenes!"{w}
